{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2019-10-15 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE MOSAIC COMPANY DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 19, 2019', 'text': 'THE MOSAIC COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.05 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY’S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON DECEMBER 19, 2019, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 5, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2019-10-15 10:30:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC UNIT ISSUED IMMINENT DANGER ORDER AT ITS CARLSBAD MINE', 'text': 'MOSAIC - UNIT WAS ISSUED IMMINENT DANGER ORDER BY U.S. DEPARTMENT OF LABOR, MINE SAFETY & HEALTH ADMINISTRATION AT ITS MINE AT CARLSBAD, NEW MEXICO.MOSAIC - ORDER WAS ISSUED UPON OBSERVING A MECHANIC WORKING UNDER RAISED FORKS OF A CAT FORKLIFT.MOSAIC - NO ONE WAS INJURED AS A RESULT OF THE INCIDENT AT CARLSBAD MINE, NEW MEXICO.MOSAIC - IMMINENT DANGER AS A RESULT OF THE INCIDENT AT CARLSBAD MINE, NEW MEXICO ,HAS BEEN ADDRESSED.'}